  "description": "It’s been another full-on, non-stop year for Plastik Funk, who has spent the last 12 months appearing at Ultra Festival Miami and Europe, [UNVRS] and Hï Ibiza, and Tomorrowland, as well as touring Asia several times.\n\nPlastik Funk, aka Rafael Ximenez-Carrillo, puts his amazing success this year down to one specific thing, “A year and a half ago I went back to my house music and tech-house roots and didn’t know if the fans would accept it. We packed the Tomorrowland Freedom stage in no time and I saw all the feedback to my new music: it was amazing.”",
